  "description": "VOODOO HORDE\n\nNo matter whether you are a solitary rider who wants to be one with nature, or a wolf who never rides without a pack; you will never be alone while riding with the Horde. The well renowned alloy Voodoo frame is this time topped with a boost SR Suntour fork, a 10-speed Shimano drivetrain and Tektro hydraulic brakes to provide a solid MTB platform that will ride with you through any trail.\n\nAs with all the other MTBs from the Spirits range, the frame is compatible with dropper seatposts and the wheels are tubeless compatible for when you feel ready to tackle some gnarlier terrain. The Horde will be ready.\n\nAre you brave enough to join the Horde?",
